1
00:00:01,470 --> 00:00:04,850
So, like, ever since Morishige
was dumped by Miura,

2
00:00:04,850 --> 00:00:07,360
he's been texting Hiroko nonstop.

3
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:09,800
What? Ew.

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,380
I guess Matsuzaki is single now, too.

5
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:16,740
Oh, yeah. Hey, Tsubomi.
Wanna go to karaoke after school?

6
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:21,200
Huh? Uh, sorry, I'm actually
a bit under the weather.

7
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:22,140
I'll pass.

8
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:25,660
Huh? Really? You should hang out
with us every once in a while.

9
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:31,420
Oh, shit! Snot just exploded everywhere!

10
00:00:31,420 --> 00:00:34,660
Come on. You don't have to
sing, so just come with us.

11
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:39,220
Maybe next time.
Hey, do you two have any tissues?

12
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:40,320
Nope.

13
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:45,640
I'm going to go throw this in the garbage,
so put the cleaning tools away for me.

14
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:49,440
We'll go with you. Let's walk slow
so we can kill some time.

15
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:52,260
Why are you covering your face?

16
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:53,840
Hm? Oh, no reason.

17
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,420
Wait, what is it? I'm so curious now.

18
00:00:55,420 --> 00:00:56,900
Come on, move your hand!

19
00:00:57,170 --> 00:01:03,350
O-Oh, no... If they see my
face covered in snot...

20
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:08,050
Wanna see a picture of Takane Tsubomi's
face just covered in snot from yesterday?

21
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:10,580
Ew, gross!

22
00:01:10,580 --> 00:01:11,900
Oh, crap!

23
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:13,550
You can't be serious!

24
00:01:13,550 --> 00:01:16,250
That's bound to happen.

25
00:01:16,540 --> 00:01:18,500
Hey, you two...

26
00:01:20,330 --> 00:01:22,930
The teacher was looking for you.

27
00:01:22,930 --> 00:01:25,230
Ugh, lame.

28
00:01:25,230 --> 00:01:26,960
Well, this sucks.

29
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:32,070
Wait, Tsubomi.

30
00:01:32,820 --> 00:01:35,570
Sorry, now's not a good time.

31
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:37,750
Here you go. Some tissues.

32
00:01:44,580 --> 00:01:47,410
Thank you so much, Mob.

33
00:01:47,410 --> 00:01:49,180
Oh, sure.

34
00:01:49,590 --> 00:01:54,270
You know, it's been a
while since we talked.

35
00:01:54,610 --> 00:01:55,440
Yeah.

36
00:01:56,230 --> 00:01:57,300
Thanks.

37
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:59,390
Well, I'll see you later.

38
00:01:59,390 --> 00:02:00,470
See you later?!

39
00:02:00,470 --> 00:02:02,848
(See you later)

40
00:02:10,090 --> 00:02:11,180
Mob!

41
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,570
You got a second?

42
00:02:15,570 --> 00:02:16,640
Mezato.

43
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:19,150
On Sunday night,

44
00:02:19,150 --> 00:02:23,120
there's going to be a huge gathering
for the Psycho Helmet Religion.

45
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,610
Will you come?

46
00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:27,540
Sorry, I'm just not interested.

47
00:02:27,540 --> 00:02:29,970
Please! Just for a little bit!

48
00:02:29,970 --> 00:02:31,660
Cough! Ahem...

49
00:02:33,010 --> 00:02:34,010
Erm...

50
00:02:34,810 --> 00:02:35,660
Tome.

51
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:42,220
Mob, do you realize you promised
you'd help me find telepathists on Sunday?

52
00:02:42,450 --> 00:02:44,540
Oh, right...

53
00:02:45,260 --> 00:02:48,910
Anyway, think it over.
I'll call your house.

54
00:02:50,230 --> 00:02:51,790
Kageyama.

55
00:02:52,260 --> 00:02:54,560
Emi? What brings you here?

56
00:02:54,560 --> 00:02:57,370
I was just observing.
You're totally popular.

57
00:02:57,370 --> 00:02:59,370
Way to go, Kageyama.

58
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,540
Sorry?

59
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:05,060
Oh, look at you playing dumb.

60
00:03:05,810 --> 00:03:09,140
Popular? Me?

61
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:15,290
But you know... I did actually
talk to a lot of girls today.

62
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:20,710
And even though it wasn't for long,
I got to talk to Tsubomi alone, too.

63
00:03:21,410 --> 00:03:25,380
Brother! Are you heading home?
Let's walk home together.

64
00:03:26,010 --> 00:03:26,980
Ritsu...

65
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:30,250
Would you lend me your ear for a second?

66
00:03:30,250 --> 00:03:31,320
What's up?

67
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:33,370
I...

68
00:03:34,970 --> 00:03:37,200
