69
00:03:37,430 --> 00:03:38,180
Huh?

70
00:03:38,810 --> 00:03:41,820
Er, sorry! Forget I ever said anything.

71
00:03:41,820 --> 00:03:43,360
Uh, Brother!

72
00:03:43,610 --> 00:03:47,410
I'm sure I just got the wrong idea again.
How embarrassing.

73
00:03:51,900 --> 00:03:53,930
I-I'm being watched?

74
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:56,730
The girls passing by keep glancing at me?

75
00:03:57,320 --> 00:03:59,850
Kageyama's so hot.

76
00:04:00,650 --> 00:04:02,290
I'm not imagining it.

77
00:04:02,290 --> 00:04:04,580
They're whispering as
they glance over at me.

78
00:04:04,580 --> 00:04:07,593
Right? Ritsu's great and so refined.

79
00:04:07,595 --> 00:04:10,760
Could it be... I'm right? No...

80
00:04:10,760 --> 00:04:13,720
I'm definitely popular.

81
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:16,180
Shigeo's so hot.

82
00:04:16,188 --> 00:04:17,690
(Hearing things)

83
00:04:26,740 --> 00:04:29,830
(Mob on a high horse 100%)

84
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:34,100
Finally... Congrats, Nii-san.

85
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:40,030
(MOB MOB WOW!)

86
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:42,910
(MOB MOB WOW!)

87
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:45,750
(MOB MOB WOW!)

88
00:04:46,910 --> 00:04:48,580
(MOB MOB WOW!)

89
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:52,710
I realized that our youth is Grey

90
00:04:52,710 --> 00:04:55,630
The origin of this uneasiness
Is yet unknown

91
00:04:55,710 --> 00:04:58,130
Trains of emotions keep running
Through my brain

92
00:04:58,130 --> 00:05:01,300
Struggling through this adolescence

93
00:05:01,430 --> 00:05:04,260
Don't disturb my deep psyche

94
00:05:04,260 --> 00:05:06,930
