95
00:05:07,060 --> 00:05:10,730
Opposing ideas creates distortion

96
00:05:10,730 --> 00:05:14,150
Exorcise all the sorrow

97
00:05:14,320 --> 00:05:17,820
So, do what you can now

98
00:05:17,900 --> 00:05:19,740
My life

99
00:05:19,990 --> 00:05:23,870
Finally, break it down

100
00:05:25,370 --> 00:05:28,200
(Want) Both greed
(Young) And honesty

101
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:31,080
(Burn) Are growing
(1) On this chest of mine

102
00:05:31,080 --> 00:05:33,840
(Trance) I'm not waking up
(Chance) I want to wake up

103
00:05:33,840 --> 00:05:36,800
(Stance) These two different faces of mine
(1) Are standing back-to-back

104
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:39,300
Taking things as it is

105
00:05:39,300 --> 00:05:42,720
In this free relation where
We resent each other

106
00:05:42,800 --> 00:05:45,010
Once these two become one

107
00:05:45,010 --> 00:05:47,020
That smile becomes one

108
00:05:47,020 --> 00:05:50,100
And only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

109
00:05:50,770 --> 00:05:53,770
"1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

110
00:05:54,110 --> 00:05:55,190
(MOB MOB WOW!)

111
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:58,070
One and only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

112
00:05:58,230 --> 00:05:59,780
"1"

113
00:05:59,780 --> 00:06:00,950
(MOB MOB WOW!)

114
00:06:00,950 --> 00:06:03,240
One and only "1"

115
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,970
Is that the Divine Tree?

116
00:06:06,970 --> 00:06:08,120
It's huge!

117
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,360
Let's take a picture!

118
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,680
Yeah!

119
00:06:12,140 --> 00:06:14,180
Well? Isn't the view great?

120
00:06:14,180 --> 00:06:15,520
It's lovely.

121
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:19,750
We're currently selling a roll cake
inspired by the Divine Tree.

122
00:06:19,750 --> 00:06:21,620
It might even be lucky!

123
00:06:22,430 --> 00:06:27,820
The Divine Tree is on our side.
It will answer our prayers!

124
00:06:28,380 --> 00:06:31,320
The helix of life embraced by the earth...

125
00:06:31,750 --> 00:06:37,060
We are nothing but tiny beings
of life says the Divine Tree.

126
00:06:38,580 --> 00:06:44,740
When many desires and wishes gather in
one place, a new divinity is born.

127
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:51,710
This broccoli ended up becoming
the symbol of some god.

128
00:06:52,610 --> 00:06:55,850
Its believers' energy of desire is colossal.

129
00:06:55,850 --> 00:06:59,680
And with this energy, the Divine Tree
continues to grow even more.

130
00:07:00,380 --> 00:07:05,680
However, this thing's just a huge broccoli
and has no power to actually lead the people.

131
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:12,460
So, I'll just take that
energy and put it to good use.

132
00:07:12,460 --> 00:07:17,880
If this world needs a god so badly,
then I'll do the shepherding myself.

133
00:07:18,280 --> 00:07:21,340
I'll produce a founder for the religious
organization missing theirs,

134
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:26,140
the Psycho Helmet Religion.

135
00:07:28,170 --> 00:07:32,680
(Getting Carried Away
~100%~)

136
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,970
Shige, you've got a phone call.

137
00:07:35,210 --> 00:07:36,880
It's a girl!

138
00:07:38,990 --> 00:07:40,150
Hello?

139
00:07:40,590 --> 00:07:42,390
Oh, Mezato.

140
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:45,180
So you want to talk about that one thing.

141
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:48,770
I keep telling you this,
but I'm not cut out for that.

142
00:07:48,770 --> 00:07:53,780
Wait! Things really are changing, though.

143
00:07:54,080 --> 00:07:56,190
Ever since the Divine Tree
showed up in our city,

144
00:07:56,190 --> 00:08:01,370
a bunch of people have claimed to be the
founder of the Psycho Helmet Religion.

145
00:08:01,370 --> 00:08:04,080
And now, they're going to hold an audition

146
00:08:04,080 --> 00:08:06,620
to decide on the founder.

147
00:08:06,970 --> 00:08:07,920
At this rate,

148
00:08:08,170 --> 00:08:12,540
someone else is going to end up being
the founder of the Psycho Helmet Religion!

149
00:08:12,730 --> 00:08:15,520
I can't let that happen!
That'd be so lame!

150
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:20,550
I'll call you back from my cellphone.

151
00:08:21,300 --> 00:08:24,120
There are over 500,000 believers!

152
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:28,060
Wouldn't it be interesting if the founder
were a second-year middle school boy?

153
00:08:28,060 --> 00:08:30,960
And you also happen to be a psychic!

154
00:08:30,960 --> 00:08:33,900
That's so mysterious and cool!

155
00:08:34,310 --> 00:08:37,300
I'm certain that'll make you
super popular with the girls.

156
00:08:37,780 --> 00:08:40,130
Even with Takane, too!

157
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,040
Huh?

158
00:08:41,550 --> 00:08:42,740
What's wrong?

159
00:08:43,390 --> 00:08:46,490
Wait, Mezato, do you also...

160
00:08:47,220 --> 00:08:49,100
Er, never mind.

161
00:08:49,100 --> 00:08:50,210
What?

162
00:08:50,540 --> 00:08:55,500
Anyway, what everyone needs isn't
some phony. It's you, Mob.

163
00:08:55,830 --> 00:08:57,870
You need to come to founder audition, okay?

164
00:09:00,490 --> 00:09:02,830
Everyone needs me...

165
00:09:04,210 --> 00:09:07,220
Maybe it won't be so bad
to be the founder...

166
00:09:07,220 --> 00:09:09,020
Well said, Shigeo!

167
00:09:09,730 --> 00:09:11,850
Dimple?! You startled me.

168
00:09:11,850 --> 00:09:15,560
I haven't seen you in a while.
What happened?

169
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:19,910
What happened? That's my line.
What's with the face and voice, man?

170
00:09:19,910 --> 00:09:21,110
What happened?

171
00:09:22,840 --> 00:09:24,750
I see.

172
00:09:25,180 --> 00:09:27,890
You got the wrong idea because
she said, "See you later."

173
00:09:28,350 --> 00:09:31,600
No, that's not a misunderstanding.
That's the truth.

174
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:34,290
Thinking that just because
you talked to a girl

175
00:09:34,290 --> 00:09:36,510
happens all the time to prepubescent boys.

176
00:09:36,510 --> 00:09:38,810
Those stares you think you're seeing
are also a misunderstanding.

177
00:09:38,810 --> 00:09:43,520
Seriously, no one even notices you,
more than you can imagine.

178
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:47,020
Why would you say that? You weren't there.

179
00:09:47,390 --> 00:09:51,060
I'm telling you this because
I care about you.

180
00:09:51,060 --> 00:09:53,570
You're not actually popular right now.

181
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:56,790
What did you want, anyway?

182
00:09:56,790 --> 00:10:01,250
Good question. Oh, right.
About the founder audition!

183
00:10:01,620 --> 00:10:03,120
Huh? What about it?

184
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:05,570
You can't just sit there quietly, can you?

185
00:10:05,570 --> 00:10:07,110
It's time to make our move!

186
00:10:07,110 --> 00:10:11,270
This is our time to rise to the top!
Let's go together.

187
00:10:11,270 --> 00:10:12,210
Why?

188
00:10:12,780 --> 00:10:13,580
Huh?

189
00:10:14,370 --> 00:10:17,390
This has nothing to do with you, Dimple.

190
00:10:17,390 --> 00:10:22,040
But the predecessor to the
Psycho Helmet Religion, (LOL),

191
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:24,100
was created by me...

192
00:10:25,740 --> 00:10:28,510
But you gathered people there by
brainwashing them, didn't you?

193
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:30,980
Apparently with the Psycho Helmet Religion,

194
00:10:30,980 --> 00:10:34,810
everyone gathered on their own
and they're all having fun peacefully,

195
00:10:34,810 --> 00:10:36,840
so getting in the way is bad.

196
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:40,650
B-But having a proficient
leader is important.

197
00:10:40,650 --> 00:10:44,660
What those people want is someone
who has divine powers.

198
00:10:44,660 --> 00:10:46,610
I know.

199
00:10:48,660 --> 00:10:50,860
And that's why it can't be you, Dimple.

200
00:10:50,860 --> 00:10:54,620
The one everyone is seeking is me,
not you, Dimple.

201
00:10:55,260 --> 00:10:57,440
He's totally crarried away...

202
00:10:58,110 --> 00:11:02,220
Please. You think you have the
power to control the masses?

203
00:11:02,800 --> 00:11:05,710
I didn't say anything about
being their founder.

204
00:11:06,170 --> 00:11:08,810
I know I'm not cut out for that.

205
00:11:08,810 --> 00:11:10,220
And that's why

206
00:11:10,220 --> 00:11:16,410
if you and I join forces,
a super-elite religion will be born!

207
00:11:16,410 --> 00:11:17,770
Which means...

208
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:21,000
It'll be the inception of a new god!

209
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:23,610
So is this god you, Dimple?

210
00:11:23,610 --> 00:11:24,370
Er...

211
00:11:24,370 --> 00:11:26,160
What, exactly, do you want to do as god?

212
00:11:26,520 --> 00:11:28,710
I haven't decided that yet...

213
00:11:28,710 --> 00:11:32,620
But I'd probably end up with powers
beyond my wildest imagination.

214
00:11:33,310 --> 00:11:35,940
Well, I'm not interested in power,

215
00:11:35,940 --> 00:11:38,850
so I'm not going to be
able to help you out.

216
00:11:38,850 --> 00:11:42,300
Wha... Are you trying to
keep me out of this?!

217
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:46,850
Keep this up, and some other
jackass is gonna take over!

218
00:11:47,060 --> 00:11:49,930
They're gonna keep all of this
divine energy to themselves!

219
00:11:50,520 --> 00:11:55,050
So the reason you're stronger now is you
stole some of the energy from the broccoli.

220
00:11:56,530 --> 00:11:58,680
That's fine and all, but...

221
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:02,100
You're also trying to take
them over, too, aren't you?

222
00:12:02,100 --> 00:12:05,630
No! I'm just... You see...

223
00:12:05,630 --> 00:12:08,950
So what makes you different
from the other guys?

224
00:12:10,010 --> 00:12:11,120
Dimple...

225
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:14,200
Why don't you give
your schemes a rest already?

226
00:12:21,130 --> 00:12:22,220
Dimple.

227
00:12:25,810 --> 00:12:27,470
Haven't seen you in a while...

228
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:38,730
(Spirits and Such Consultation Office)

229
00:12:38,730 --> 00:12:40,480
(Saturday)
(Spirits and Such Consultation Office)

230
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:43,960
So how's night school going, Serizawa?

231
00:12:44,750 --> 00:12:47,420
It's a bit nerve-racking,
but I think I'll make it through.

232
00:12:47,420 --> 00:12:51,790
I've sort of given up on making
friends, but I'll do my best.

233
00:12:54,210 --> 00:12:57,580
What about you, Mob?
Anything interesting lately?

234
00:12:58,110 --> 00:13:00,300
Yes, sort of...

235
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:02,650
What is it? Tell us already.

236
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:07,050
It's rare of you to ask us this
yourself, Master Reigen.

237
00:13:07,270 --> 00:13:10,180
There's so little going on
that I'm bored out of my mind.

238
00:13:10,180 --> 00:13:12,380
I mean, look at these jobs.

239
00:13:12,860 --> 00:13:15,240
We've got like four requests to find out

240
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:19,250
if the sudden deterioration of some buildings
is due to some supernatural phenomena.

241
00:13:19,990 --> 00:13:23,700
They must've gotten the wong idea
that we just do odd jobs.

242
00:13:24,090 --> 00:13:25,650
I guess we don't just do odd jobs...

243
00:13:25,860 --> 00:13:30,100
I don't have any other work for you
two today, so you can go home.

244
00:13:30,610 --> 00:13:31,960
All right.

245
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:33,110
Oh, wait a sec.

246
00:13:33,470 --> 00:13:36,470
That is, after I hear whatever interesting
thing is going on in your life, Mob.

247
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:42,280
What? You think you've finally
become popular lately?

248
00:13:42,620 --> 00:13:45,580
Right. Welp, we're done for the day.
Good work, boys.

249
00:13:45,830 --> 00:13:47,630
If you'll excuse me.

250
00:13:48,700 --> 00:13:51,080
Oh, there's one other thing.

251
00:13:51,520 --> 00:13:55,020
Tomorrow, I'll be attending a gathering
for some religious group.

252
00:13:55,020 --> 00:13:58,090
Wha... Uh, are you okay with that?

253
00:13:58,670 --> 00:14:00,820
I got invited.

254
00:14:00,820 --> 00:14:04,320
Apparently, this group was formed
because of my actions,

255
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:07,030
so they want me to be their founder.

256
00:14:08,150 --> 00:14:09,980
And are you going to be their founder?

257
00:14:10,280 --> 00:14:16,090
I could if I wanted to... But I should
probably meet everyone first.

258
00:14:16,330 --> 00:14:18,460
Good God, he's on a high horse.

259
00:14:19,100 --> 00:14:21,510
Psycho... what was it again?

260
00:14:21,510 --> 00:14:23,280
The Psycho Helmet Religion.

261
00:14:24,440 --> 00:14:26,060
Oh, here we go.

262
00:14:27,250 --> 00:14:29,000
Talk about half-assed...

263
00:14:30,190 --> 00:14:32,490
Yikes, don't do it, Mob.

264
00:14:32,490 --> 00:14:34,400
This is clearly shady as...

265
00:14:34,710 --> 00:14:35,380
Hm?

266
00:14:35,730 --> 00:14:39,920
580,000 believers?! It's that popular?!

267
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:42,250
They've even got monetary donations...

268
00:14:42,610 --> 00:14:44,470
I-I...

269
00:14:44,470 --> 00:14:47,030
smell a delicious business
opportunity here.

270
00:14:49,590 --> 00:14:51,290
Go to that gathering!

271
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:55,790
A true man should be the founder of
a religious group at least once!

272
00:14:55,790 --> 00:14:56,500
And!

273
00:14:56,810 --> 00:15:01,580
Make sure you tell your believers
that you have a master, too!

274
00:15:01,580 --> 00:15:02,470
Right...

275
00:15:02,790 --> 00:15:05,410
So, what are you going to wear?

276
00:15:05,410 --> 00:15:07,640
This is going to be your
time in the spotlight.

277
00:15:08,510 --> 00:15:09,340
Huh?

278
00:15:09,810 --> 00:15:12,010
Looks like they're going
to stream this online, too.

279
00:15:12,010 --> 00:15:15,310
There's going to be hundreds of
thousands of people watching you.

280
00:15:15,870 --> 00:15:17,880
What should I wear?

281
00:15:19,030 --> 00:15:21,360
Stick out your hands, Mob.

282
00:15:24,020 --> 00:15:27,590
Here's a bonus. Now go buy yourself
something nice to wear.

283
00:15:28,460 --> 00:15:29,640
Master!

284
00:15:30,340 --> 00:15:32,030
Thank you so much!

285
00:15:34,820 --> 00:15:36,643
I'm here to shop for clothes,

286
00:15:36,645 --> 00:15:40,051
but I have no idea what kind of clothes
to wear in the spotlight.

287
00:15:40,520 --> 00:15:42,890
I guess I'll go home and talk to Ritsu...

288
00:15:43,300 --> 00:15:44,690
Kageyama?

289
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:47,740
It is you!

290
00:15:47,740 --> 00:15:49,050
Hanazawa!

291
00:15:50,670 --> 00:15:54,320
I see. Well, leave that to me.

292
00:15:54,740 --> 00:15:56,760
I know plenty of perfect shops.

293
00:15:57,220 --> 00:15:59,720
That's great! Thanks!

294
00:16:05,280 --> 00:16:08,150
I've been observing
what's going on in the city...

295
00:16:08,770 --> 00:16:11,400
but I guess you've noticed it, too.

296
00:16:12,130 --> 00:16:15,100
There's something gradually happening here.

297
00:16:16,070 --> 00:16:17,980
No, wait...

298
00:16:19,460 --> 00:16:21,160
Is there something going
on with those girls?

299
00:16:21,640 --> 00:16:22,700
Well...

300
00:16:23,260 --> 00:16:27,680
Lately, I feel like there are
a lot of girls staring at me.

301
00:16:27,910 --> 00:16:31,370
I know I probably have the wrong
idea, but it's been on my mind.

302
00:16:31,750 --> 00:16:33,330
Oho...

303
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:34,840
Kageyama...

304
00:16:35,110 --> 00:16:37,280
That's not a misunderstanding.

305
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:41,300
You're just so cool that the girls
can't help but look your way.

306
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:43,730
No way. That can't be true...

307
00:16:44,110 --> 00:16:47,900
That can't be true... or is it?

308
00:16:48,190 --> 00:16:49,660
Aw, shucks.

309
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:52,390
Let's just leave it at that.

310
00:16:52,780 --> 00:16:55,370
Come on. Let's get you some hip clothes.

311
00:16:55,370 --> 00:16:56,690
Okay!

312
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:01,290
Hey, this will probably look good.

313
00:17:01,570 --> 00:17:04,460
Oh, but this is above my budget.

314
00:17:04,460 --> 00:17:07,780
I see.
Well, everything here is a bit pricey.

315
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:12,040
How about this? This is a super-popular
brand called Smart Monkey.

316
00:17:12,040 --> 00:17:15,240
If possible, I'd like to keep
it under or at 5,000 yen.

317
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:17,000
Okay, I'm sure we'll find something.

318
00:17:17,620 --> 00:17:19,220
Hm? Here we go!

319
00:17:19,480 --> 00:17:22,680
This also has a monkey design
and it's 5,000 yen on the dot.

320
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:25,140
Yay! Let's go with that.

321
00:17:25,490 --> 00:17:27,590
Thanks, Hanazawa-kun.

322
00:17:31,070 --> 00:17:32,270
Nii-san...

323
00:17:32,490 --> 00:17:34,570
Are you gonna go out wearing that?

324
00:17:34,850 --> 00:17:37,770
Yup! Hanazawa helped me pick this out.

325
00:17:38,200 --> 00:17:41,130
Right... I see.

326
00:17:41,410 --> 00:17:42,340
Okay.

327
00:17:45,170 --> 00:17:46,680
But you know...

328
00:17:47,350 --> 00:17:49,070
I'm seeing Tome this afternoon,

329
00:17:49,070 --> 00:17:50,770
and then Mezato tonight.

330
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:52,660
I'm so busy.

331
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:57,730
Tome's a bit late...

332
00:18:02,270 --> 00:18:05,530
I was so worried that I just didn't
really get it in the end...

333
00:18:06,200 --> 00:18:09,640
But is this shirt really that cool?

334
00:18:15,990 --> 00:18:17,860
She's not answering her phone either.

335
00:18:18,260 --> 00:18:21,050
I wonder if something happened to Tome.

336
00:18:22,910 --> 00:18:27,700
Anyone auditioning, please head on in.

337
00:18:27,700 --> 00:18:31,420
The emergence of the Divine Tree
is a message from the Earth.

338
00:18:31,420 --> 00:18:33,870
The Divine Tree is the
legendary dragon's nest.

339
00:18:34,210 --> 00:18:36,840
The Divine Tree is a sign
that nature is angry...

340
00:18:38,340 --> 00:18:43,930
As if any of these shady religious organizations
can handle the true powers of the Divine Tree.

341
00:18:45,830 --> 00:18:50,800
We, the Rising Sun Spiritual
Union, shall look after it.

342
00:18:50,800 --> 00:18:54,720
Please speak of these
things further inside.

343
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:56,600
I'll walk you down.

344
00:19:00,230 --> 00:19:02,910
There are so many people here.

345
00:19:02,910 --> 00:19:07,130
The Psycho Helmet Religion
is partially a joke, right?

346
00:19:07,130 --> 00:19:09,420
So where'd all these people come from?

347
00:19:09,420 --> 00:19:12,080
There's not going to be a riot, is there?

348
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:16,300
Don't worry.
Let's believe in what he says.

349
00:19:17,200 --> 00:19:21,000
In our founder who suddenly
showed himself yesterday.

350
00:19:21,570 --> 00:19:26,410
And the one who speaks for the
Divine Tree, Psycho Helmet-sama.

351
00:19:27,240 --> 00:19:30,756
We tried calling
the number you have dialed,

352
00:19:30,758 --> 00:19:32,800
but the call cannot be completed.

353
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:35,100
Mezato-san's not answering...

354
00:19:36,060 --> 00:19:38,490
She hasn't even told me
where everyone's meeting yet.

355
00:19:39,310 --> 00:19:41,040
I guess I'll wait a little longer.

356
00:19:45,490 --> 00:19:46,770
Yowch.

357
00:19:48,460 --> 00:19:50,540
Mob sure is taking his time to appear.

358
00:19:51,230 --> 00:19:53,460
Did he chicken out?

359
00:19:54,540 --> 00:19:59,040
Oh, there he is.
Well, he seems pretty confident.

360
00:19:59,050 --> 00:20:03,010
(Psycho Helmet Religion)

361
00:20:03,670 --> 00:20:06,020
It's a pleasure to meet you, everyone.

362
00:20:06,480 --> 00:20:10,970
I will be the one who will serve
as the founder of this religion,

363
00:20:10,970 --> 00:20:13,280
Psycho Helmet.

364
00:20:13,280 --> 00:20:15,290
What the hell? That's not Mob.

365
00:20:15,770 --> 00:20:17,680
The hell's going on?

366
00:20:18,940 --> 00:20:20,690
Damn it, his phone's out of battery.

367
00:20:23,030 --> 00:20:25,660
But with the terrorist
attack the other day,

368
00:20:25,660 --> 00:20:29,880
I have realized that we need
someone to protect this city.

369
00:20:30,230 --> 00:20:34,640
From now on, I will be the one who
will lead everyone to happiness.

370
00:20:35,090 --> 00:20:41,100
I plan to change this degenerate world
along with the Psycho Helmet Religion.

371
00:20:42,780 --> 00:20:44,520
My battery's dead.

372
00:20:44,520 --> 00:20:48,950
I am also the creator of the Divine Tree.

373
00:20:48,950 --> 00:20:53,790
It is the symbol of the Psycho Helmet
Religion and its carefree nature.

374
00:20:53,790 --> 00:20:57,199
The Divine Tree
grows with everyone's desires

375
00:20:57,201 --> 00:20:59,590
and will bring the world happiness.

376
00:20:59,590 --> 00:21:02,220
Please think of that tree as me

377
00:21:03,590 --> 00:21:06,270
and continue praying to it.

378
00:21:06,270 --> 00:21:09,078
Objection! The Divine Tree is the
egg in which the great Mossar-sama sleeps!

379
00:21:09,080 --> 00:21:10,740
O Divine Tree! Please quell your rage!

380
00:21:10,740 --> 00:21:14,210
That's also wrong! The Divine Tree
is the mecca for the Dragon's Sigh!

381
00:21:14,210 --> 00:21:15,310
Psycho helmet, my ass! You fake religion!

382
00:21:15,310 --> 00:21:16,460
-Yeesh...
Psycho helmet, my ass! You fake religion!

383
00:21:16,460 --> 00:21:16,760
That is a device that connects dimensions!

384
00:21:16,760 --> 00:21:18,550
-Things are getting interesting.
That is a device that connects dimensions!

385
00:21:18,550 --> 00:21:20,566
Quit lying!

386
00:21:20,568 --> 00:21:24,771
The Divine Tree will only bring about
happiness under our supervision!

387
00:21:25,290 --> 00:21:26,900
I will now show you...

388
00:21:27,910 --> 00:21:29,720
...a miracle.

389
00:21:40,640 --> 00:21:41,610
Huh?!

390
00:21:41,610 --> 00:21:42,850
It's a broccoli!

391
00:21:42,850 --> 00:21:43,870
Bro...

392
00:21:43,870 --> 00:21:46,910
What the heck just happened?!

393
00:21:55,940 --> 00:22:00,780
The blue light shined
Dazzling my eye at 01:30 AM

394
00:22:00,820 --> 00:22:06,160
Even as I swiped the page over,
The smiles of friends besides me remain

395
00:22:16,170 --> 00:22:18,590
Yes, I want someone to understand

396
00:22:18,590 --> 00:22:21,090
All the colorless and transparent wishes

397
00:22:21,090 --> 00:22:23,590
All the breath stuck within
The depth of my heart

398
00:22:23,590 --> 00:22:26,220
Suddenly flowed out
Bringing my consciousness back

399
00:22:26,220 --> 00:22:28,680
I remember the days hung dry

400
00:22:28,680 --> 00:22:31,180
The very normal days passed by

401
00:22:31,180 --> 00:22:33,650
Even if reality is corrupted

402
00:22:33,650 --> 00:22:36,400
The sky we saw together
Was definitely real

403
00:22:36,980 --> 00:22:41,110
It's harder to understand than
The grammar on the blackboard

404
00:22:41,110 --> 00:22:46,320
The story that disappears
Under 24 hours makes me sad and lonely

405
00:22:46,590 --> 00:22:50,790
It's so hard, and I find myself
On the verge of giving up again and again

406
00:22:50,790 --> 00:22:52,330
But I...

407
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:56,500
The current me will no longer give up

408
00:22:56,630 --> 00:23:01,510
Overflowing emotions on my sleeve,
Running through worry and doubt

409
00:23:01,510 --> 00:23:04,138
Nobody has decided
if the future is 0 or 100,

410
00:23:04,140 --> 00:23:06,720
So I'll paint over them myself

411
00:23:06,720 --> 00:23:09,104
Even if my existence itself
can't be proven,

412
00:23:09,106 --> 00:23:12,141
If this world struck me in my heart

413
00:23:12,270 --> 00:23:14,810
I will flood it with cobalt blue

414
00:23:26,130 --> 00:23:27,040
This isn't good, Mob!

415
00:23:27,040 --> 00:23:29,320
We're gonna be outta business
because of that broccoli!

416
00:23:29,320 --> 00:23:31,020
Who cares if it's holy or popular?

417
00:23:31,020 --> 00:23:32,430
We're gonna go destroy it!

418
00:23:32,430 --> 00:23:34,400
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 III Episode 4:

419
00:23:34,400 --> 00:23:36,260
"Divine Tree 1 ~The Founder Appears~"

420
00:23:36,260 --> 00:23:39,480
A streaming service? But of course,
that's an excellent decision!
